{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1385","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. a-Good String"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a string $$$s[1 \\dots n]$$$ consisting of lowercase Latin letters. It is guaranteed that $$$n = 2^k$$$ for some integer $$$k \\ge 0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The string $$$s[1 \\dots n]$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$c$$$-good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at least one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the following three conditions is satisfied:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The length of $$$s$$$ is $$$1$$$, and it consists of the character $$$c$$$ (i.e. $$$s_1=c$$$);"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The length of $$$s$$$ is greater than $$$1$$$, the first half of the string consists of only the character $$$c$$$ (i.e. $$$s_1=s_2=\\dots=s_{\\frac{n}{2}}=c$$$) and the second half of the string (i.e. the string $$$s_{\\frac{n}{2} + 1}s_{\\frac{n}{2} + 2} \\dots s_n$$$) is a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$(c+1)$$$-good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The length of $$$s$$$ is greater than $$$1$$$, the second half of the string consists of only the character $$$c$$$ (i.e. $$$s_{\\frac{n}{2} + 1}=s_{\\frac{n}{2} + 2}=\\dots=s_n=c$$$) and the first half of the string (i.e. the string $$$s_1s_2 \\dots s_{\\frac{n}{2}}$$$) is a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$(c+1)$$$-good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aabc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"'"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'-good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ffgheeee"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"'"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"e"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'-good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In one move, you can choose one index $$$i$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$n$$$ and replace $$$s_i$$$ with any lowercase Latin letter (any character from '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"')."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find the minimum number of moves required to obtain an "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"'"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'-good"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string from $$$s$$$ (i.e. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$c$$$-good string"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for $$$c=$$$ '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'). It is guaranteed that the answer always exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$t$$$ independent test cases."}],"kind":"paragr